{"source_id": "S0013", "status": "read", "units": [{"location": "paragraph:1", "text": "MBTI职业性格测试题-2", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:2", "text": "说明：                                            姓名：                ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:3", "text": "1.    请在心态平和及时间充足的情况下才开始答题。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:4", "text": "2.    每道题目均有两个答案:A 和B。请仔细阅读题目,按照与你性格相符的程度分别给A和B 赋予一个分数,并使一组中的两个分数之和为5。最后,请在问卷后的答题纸上相应的方格内填上相应的分数。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:5", "text": "3.     请注意,题目的答案无对错之分,你不需要考虑哪个答案“应该”更好,而且不要在任何问题上思考太久,而是应该凭你心里的第一反应做出选择.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:6", "text": "4.    如果你觉得在不同的情景里,两个答案或许都能反映你的倾向,请选择一个对你的行为方式来说最自然,最顺畅和最从容的答案.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:7", "text": "例子: 你参与社交聚会时", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:8", "text": "A.    总是能认识新朋友,(4)", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:9", "text": "B.    只跟几个亲密挚友呆在一起.(1)", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:10", "text": "很明显,你参与社交聚会时有时能认识新朋友,有时又会只跟几个亲密挚友呆在一起,在以上的例子中,我们只能给总是能认识新朋友打了4分,而给只跟几个亲密挚友在一起打1分.当然,在你看来,可能是3+2或者5+0,也是其他的组合.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:11", "text": "MBTI性格类型测试问卷答题纸", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:12", "text": "以下八个偏好两两成对,也就是说,E和I,S和N, T和F , J和P各自是一对组合.在每一对组合中,比较该组合中的偏好的得分孰高孰低,高的那个就是你的优势类型.比如说,E得到22分,I得到13分,E就是优势类型;S得到19分,N得到21分,N就是优势类型.如果同分的话,选择后面的一组,即I、N、F、P. 对四对组合都作一比较以后,你会得到一个由4个字母组成的优势类型,如ENFP、ISTJ等等,把它写在下面的横线上.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:13", "text": "   ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:14", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:15", "text": "\tA", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:16", "text": "\tB", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:17", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:18", "text": "\tA", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:19", "text": "\tB", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:20", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:21", "text": "\tA", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:22", "text": "\tB", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:23", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:24", "text": "\tA", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:25", "text": "\tB", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:26", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:27", "text": "\t1", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:28", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:29", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:30", "text": "\t2", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:31", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:32", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:33", "text": "\t3", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual