iew": false}, {"location": "paragraph:232", "text": " B. 聆听的时间比说话的时间多. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:233", "text": "2.    下列哪种是你的一般生活取向?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:234", "text": "A只管做吧. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:235", "text": "B.找出多种不同的选择. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:236", "text": "3.    你喜欢自己的哪种性格?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:237", "text": "A.冷静而理性. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:238", "text": "B.热情而体谅. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:239", "text": "4.你擅长", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:240", "text": "A.在有需要时同时协调进行多项工作. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:241", "text": "B.专注在一项工作上,直到把它完成为止.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:242", "text": "5.你参与社交聚会时", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:243", "text": "A.    总是能认识新朋友.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:244", "text": "B. 只跟几个亲密挚友呆在一起.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:245", "text": "6. 当你尝试了解某些事情时,一般你会", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:246", "text": "  A .先了解细节. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:247", "text": "B.先了解整体情况,细节容后再谈.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:248", "text": "7.你对下列哪些较感兴趣?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:249", "text": "   A .知道别人的想法.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:250", "text": "B.知道别人的感受.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:251", "text": "8.你喜欢下列哪个工作?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:252", "text": " A. 能让你迅速和即时作出反应.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:253", "text": "B. 让你定出目标,然后逐步完成目标的工作.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:254", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:255", "text": "下列哪种说法较适合你?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:256", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:257", "text": "9. A.当我与友人尽兴后,我会感觉到精力充沛,并继续追求这种娱乐.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:258", "text": "B. 当我与友人尽兴后,我会感到疲惫,觉得需要一些空间.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:259", "text": "10. A.我较有兴趣知道别人的经历,例如:他们做过什么事?认识什么人? ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:260", "text": "B.我较有兴趣知道别人的计划与梦想,例如他们会往哪里去?憧憬什么?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:261", "text": "11. A.我擅长定出一些可行的计划.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:262", "text": "B.我擅长促进别人同意一些计划,并衷心合作.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:263", "text": "12 .A.我会突然尝试做某些事,看看会有什么事情发生.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:264", "text": "B.我尝试做任何事情前,都想事先知道可能有什么是发生.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:265", "text": "13. A.我会边说话,边思考.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:266", "text": "B.我在说话前,通常会思考要说什么话.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:267", "text": "14.A.四周的环境对我很重要,而且会影响我的感受.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:268", "text": "B.如果我喜欢所做的事情,气氛对我而言并不是那么重要.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:269", "text": "15. A.我喜欢分析,心思缜密.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:270", "text": "B.我对人感兴趣,关心他们所发生的事.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:271", "text": "16.A.即使已定出计划,但我也喜欢探讨其它新的方案.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:272", "text": "B.一旦计划定出,我便希望依计行事.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:273", "text": "17.A.认识我的人,一般都知道什么对我来说是重要的.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:274", "text": "B.除了我感觉亲近的人,我不会对人说出什么对我来说是重要的.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:275", "text": "18 .A. 如果我喜欢某种活动,我会经常进行这种活动.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:276", "text": "    B. 我一旦熟悉某种活动后,便希望转而尝试其他新的活动.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:277", "text": "19.A.当我作决定时,我会更多考虑正反两面的观点,并且会推理与求证.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:278", "text": "B.当我做决定时,我会更多的了解其它人的想法,并希望达成共识.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:279", "text": "20.A.当我专注某件事情时,需要不时停下来休息.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:280", "text": "B.当我专注某件事情时,不希望受到任何干扰.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:281", "text": "21.A. 我独处太久,便会感到不安.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:282", "text": "B.若没由足够的独处时间,我便会感到烦躁不安.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:283", "text": "22. A. 我对一些没有实际用途的意念不感兴趣.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:284", "text": "B 我喜欢意念的本身,并享受想象意念的过程.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:285", "text": "23.A.当进行谈判时,我依靠自己的知识与技巧.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:286", "text": "B.当进行谈判时,我会拉拢其他人至同一阵线.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:287", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:288", "text": "当你放假时,你多数会", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:289", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:290", "text": "24.A.随遇而安,做当时想做的事.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:291", "text": "B. 为想做的事情订出时间表.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:292", "text": "25.A.花多点时间,与别人共度.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:293", "text": "B.花多点时间自己阅读.散步或者发白日梦.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:294", "text": "26.A. 返回你喜欢的地方度假.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:295", "text": "B.选择前往一些你从来未达到的地方.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:296", "text": "27.A.带着一些与工作或学校有关的事情.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:297", "text": "B.处理一些对你重要的人际关系.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:298", "text": "28,A.忘记平时发生的事,专心享受.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:299", "text": "B.想着假期过后要准备的事.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:300", "text": "29.A.参观著名景点. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:301", "text": "B.花时间逛博物馆或一些较为幽静的地方.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:302", "text": "30. A.在喜欢的餐厅用膳.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:303", "text": "B.尝试新的菜式.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:304", "text": "下列哪个说法最能贴切形容你对自己的看法?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:305", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:306", "text": "31.A.别人认为我会公正的处事,并且尊重他人.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:307", "text": "B.别人相信在他们有需要时候,我会在他们的身边.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:308", "text": "32.A.随机应变.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:309", "text": "B.按照计划行事.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:310", "text": "33.A.坦率.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:311", "text": "B.深沉.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:312", "text": "34.A.留意事实.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:313", "text": " B.注重事实.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:314", "text": "35.A.知识广博.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:315", "text": "B.善解人意.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:316", "text": "36.A.容易适应转变. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:317", "text": "B.处事井井有条.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:318", "text": "37.A.爽朗.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:319", "text": "B.沉温.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:320", "text": "38.A.实事求是.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:321", "text": "B.富于想象力.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:322", "text": "39.A. 喜欢探索思考.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:323", "text": " B. 喜欢询问实情.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:324", "text": "40.A.不断的接受新意见", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:325", "text": " B. 着眼达成目标.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:326", "text": "41. A.率直.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:327", "text": "B.内敛.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:328", "text": "42.A.实事求是. ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:329", "text": "B.具有远大目光.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:330", "text": "43. A.公正.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:331", "text": "B.宽容.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:332", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:333", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:334", "text": "你会倾向:", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:335", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:336", "text": "44. A.暂时放下不愉快的事,直至有心情时才处理.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:337", "text": "B.及时处理不愉快的事情,务求把它们抛诸脑后.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:338", "text": "45．A．自己的工作被欣赏,即使自己并不满意.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:339", "text": "B.创造一些有价值的东西,但不一定需要别人知道是你做的.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:340", "text": "46.A. 在自己有兴趣的范畴,积累丰富的经验.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:341", "text": "B.有各式各样不同的经验.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:342", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:343", "text": "哪一句较能表达你的想法?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:344", "text": " 47. A.感情用事的人较容易犯错.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:345", "text": "B.逻辑思维会令人自以为是,因而容易犯错.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:346", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:347", "text": " 48.A.犹豫不决必失败.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:348", "text": "B.三思而后行.", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:349", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}], "errors": [], "characters": 3068, "ocr_units": 0, "sparse_units": ["paragraph:13", "paragraph:14", "paragraph:15", "paragraph:16", "paragraph:17", "paragraph:18", "paragraph:19", "paragraph:20", "paragraph:21", "paragraph:22", "paragraph:23", "paragraph:24", "paragraph:25", "paragraph:26", "paragraph:27", "paragraph:28", "paragraph:29", "paragraph:30", "paragraph:31", "paragraph:32", "paragraph:33", "paragraph:34", "paragraph:35", "paragraph:36", "paragraph:37", "paragraph:38", "paragraph:39", "paragraph:40", "paragraph:41", "paragraph:42", "paragraph:43", "paragraph:44", "paragraph:4